{"handle":"raunofreiberg","fetched":"2026-10-12T18:34:49.721Z","author":{"screen_name":"raunofreiberg","name":"rauno","description":"design @vercel x http://devouringdetails.com","followers":95385,"statuses":3286,"media_count":616,"joined":"Mon Dec 03 18:51:41 +0000 2018","website":{"url":"https://rauno.me","display_url":"rauno.me"}},"statuses":[{"id":"2108536941226623461","url":"https://x.com/raunofreiberg/status/2108536941226623461","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"I don't trust my output when it comes too \"easy\" ... there's no way I just happened to nail it with iteration #5 \n\nsurely it takes at least one mental breakdown to make something great... so I always keep going and even try out the \"shitty\" ideas for benchmarking","created_at":"Fri Oct 09 12:35:56 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791549356,"likes":303,"reposts":13,"replies":19,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":64,"views":33911,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2108539752819372069","url":"https://x.com/raunofreiberg/status/2108539752819372069","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"but sometimes ill make an iteration so bad that I need to remove it from the equation because it gives bad juju to the rest of the work\n\nrarely happens, but it does...","created_at":"Fri Oct 09 12:47:06 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791550026,"likes":26,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":1,"views":2437,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"raunofreiberg","status":"2108536941226623461"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2108504439921471888","url":"https://x.com/raunofreiberg/status/2108504439921471888","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"the wonderful side effect of AI is that once we're collectively fatigued from all the cool \"design details\" we will finally start to understand design as how it works, not how it looks","created_at":"Fri Oct 09 10:26:47 +0000 2