0024022354","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"the reason why im like \"idk\" is that shit that used to take roughly weeks now takes minutes and it doesnt feel the same shipping something where i missed out on the dopamine hit from actually cracking the problem myself","created_at":"Wed Aug 19 19:43:22 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1787168602,"likes":117,"reposts":4,"replies":13,"quotes":2,"bookmarks":3,"views":5343,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"raunofreiberg","status":"2090148007199072456"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2089754621245866087","url":"https://x.com/raunofreiberg/status/2089754621245866087","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"for weeks rauno sit and think really hard for good idea. sometimes walk for good idea. even run for good idea. play with son for good idea. no good idea…\n\nrauno speak to friend about trouble: want make good thing but no good idea. rauno say try everything. friend help remind rauno good idea come when make thing not when think of make thing.","created_at":"Tue Aug 18 16:41:42 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1787071302,"likes":505,"reposts":21,"replies":25,"quotes":6,"bookmarks":75,"views":29135,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2086818567308050721","url":"https://x.com/raunofreiberg/status/2086818567308050721","author_handle":"raunofreiberg","reposted":false,"text":"im convinced that knowledge gaps in absolutely anything is 100% the fault of not being able to directly manipulate the material/variables with visual realtime feedback. you learn best through play.","created_at":"Mon Aug 10 14:14:52 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1786371292,"likes":464,"reposts":18,"replies":16,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":243,"views":70253,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":{"id":"2086566417478848568","text":"My new favorite design tool.","author":"brainFnCl","media_n":1},"media":null,"reposted_b